==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Galarian Rapidash|82}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Photon Laser''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Cresselia|64}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

